# The F0 foundation and M0 do not require any secrets.
# M1: server-side secrets only; names documented in DEPLOYMENT.md.
# Never add a token, service-role key or PostgreSQL connection string to VITE_*.

# Optional M0 build configuration (non-secret): HTTPS origin, without a path.
# Leave unset for a noindex local/preview artifact. Pass in the build environment.
# SITE_URL=https://your-verified-domain
